# Packing-only override. npm reads a directory's .npmignore in preference to its
# .gitignore, and app/.gitignore ignores `dist` — correct for git, fatal for the
# tarball, because `polygraph demo` serves app/dist/ as the dashboard UI. Git
# still ignores app/dist via app/.gitignore; only npm pack sees this file.
#
# Keep this file free of globs. The root package.json "files" allowlist already
# limits this directory to app/dist/, and a pattern like `*.html` here silently
# ate app/dist/index.html, which made `demo` fall back to the old dashboard.

node_modules
